 losing blood.","ar":"أنت تنزف."},{"t":"Dad is a taxi driver.","ar":"أبي سائق سيارة أجرة."},{"t":"He gives her flowers.","ar":"هو يقدم لها الأزهار."},{"t":"Sami was losing money.","ar":"كان سامي يخسر المال."},{"t":"She waited for a taxi.","ar":"هي انتظرت سيارة أجرة."},{"t":"Ziri is a taxi driver.","ar":"زيري سائق سيارة أجرة."},{"t":"I can't take the heat.","ar":"لا أستطيع تحمل الحرارة."},{"t":"Please heat the water.","ar":"سخّن الماء من فضلك."},{"t":"Go heat up some water.","ar":"اذهب لتسخين بعض الماء."},{"t":"Can you call me a taxi?","ar":"هلا طلبت لي سيارة أجرة؟"},{"t":"Where can I get a taxi?","ar":"أين أستطيع أن أجد سيارة أجرة؟"},{"t":"Sami waited in silence.","ar":"اتظر سامي في صمت."},{"t":"Ziri broke the silence.","ar":"كسر زيري الصمت."}],"focus":["loud","example","losing","disease","force","closer","taxi","silence","gives","heat"],"words":[{"word":"loud","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"عَالٍ","example":"You're talking loud.","translation":"إنك تتكلم بصوت عالي."},{"word":"example","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"مِثَال"},{"word":"disease","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"مَرَض","example":"I have a disease.","translation":"عندي مرض."},{"word":"force","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"قُوَّة"},{"word":"taxi","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"تَاكْسِي","example":"Call a taxi.","translation":"اتصل بسيارة أجرة."},{"word":"silence","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"صَمْت","example":"Sami waited in silence.","translation":"اتظر سامي في صمت."},{"word":"heat","topic":"L148","difficulty":2,"meaning":"حَرَارَة","example":"The sun gives us light and heat.","translation":"تعطينا الشمسُ الضوءَ والحرارةَ."}],"difficulty":2}}